            "review_title": "Review at CHICKPEAEATERY",
            "review_text": "John D\nLabrador, Australia31 contributions\n0\nA lovely experience\nJan 2026 • Couples\nThis place is very rustic (sitting on mats on the floor); basically in their living room. But we loved it, and loved the food, and loved mum and dad. They found a beer for me even though it wasn't on the menu (their sister restaurant, which we visited the next day, conjured up no such compassion). This place is worth a visit just to read their menu (not about the food so much as the story of it all). A lovely experience.\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2026",
